   "text": "Vamanam",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Sanskrit therapy name, kept in source form.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d3d7930cfb1aea268cff",
   "sourceHash": "d3d7930cfb1aea268cff40cbc9eba0177802cbc38670bcc6cdd81b83e392216a",
   "text": "Het brengt de Kapha-dosha in balans via emesis (braken), zorgt voor zuurstofvoorziening en versterkt de weerstand.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2377f50c7d95af6fe4fb",
   "sourceHash": "2377f50c7d95af6fe4fb66d3f4ea13ee884d7076265b691a19979da2525b58c9",
   "text": "Virechan",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Sanskrit therapy name, kept in source form.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0f77a2bf75aad21415de",
   "sourceHash": "0f77a2bf75aad21415de6955bcac5f381a956db5755da9a6425a5020b20d9716",
   "text": "Het brengt de Pitta-dosha in balans via purgatie, versterkt de weerstand, ondersteunt de opname, afscheiding en stofwisseling in de darmen en voorziet het lichaam van zuurstof.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_36c4233e71e604dfc978",
   "sourceHash": "36c4233e71e604dfc978c6136833a28d5df691504276273868534c7518a76e49",
