   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Sanskrit therapy name, kept in source form.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cf3e85a43f4a2bf8f1fc",
   "sourceHash": "cf3e85a43f4a2bf8f1fc58991dbf7c5a84749f3d4ccb99c9a0547ced8dae5463",
   "text": "Nasyam",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Sanskrit therapy name, kept in source form.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4b6a817051756a7f75f8",
   "sourceHash": "4b6a817051756a7f75f8f75df480347eaaf385a931be4e8e445fb56d15c28a94",
   "text": "Raktamokshana",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Sanskrit therapy name, kept in source form.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9a09c2a755def3f2f5b7",
   "sourceHash": "9a09c2a755def3f2f5b799c726eee87a541d4e00da76428569830ec7a35303a5",
   "text": "Het proces waarbij onzuiver bloed uit het lichaam wordt verwijderd met bloedzuigers, naalden of hoorns. Het zuivert het bloed, bevordert de bloedsomloop en beschermt gezond weefsel tegen verontreiniging.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_632898deb9abba462f2d",
   "sourceHash": "632898deb9abba462f2de6d2b027dad48787870ddd81dd161d16ce2beb2cbba5",
   "text": "Twijfelt u nog?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_af3f72554a4897fb0f8b",
   "sourceHash": "af3f72554a4897fb0f8bc9d7c3e676717451477feea412af81df098e475bd297",
   "text": "Daarom heeft u Panchakarma-therapie nodig",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_eee1697c1fc146ea7f40",
   "sourceHash": "eee1697c1fc146ea7f401ee1d69421b7b6c20b3c2c9e6f17f79dc92a4f45043d",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]U heeft veel afvalstoffen in uw lichaam opgehoopt.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a273e64fb089ab557c50",
   "sourceHash": "a273e64fb089ab557c50344a7ed3c2fb99b1327393c6d93e40887a05670450b9",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]Uw spijsverteringskanaal is niet in orde",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_debb506e3f93761c5a6c",
   "sourceHash": "debb506e3f93761c5a6c8c840b263d6a0aeef650a5d3d98a90cec703a9b2780c",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]U heeft klachten zoals hoofdpijn, gewrichtspijn, mentale vermoeidheid, slaperigheid, stress en lusteloosheid.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f04d9db3271d1d429e4b",
   "sourceHash": "f04d9db3271d1d429e4b44685af98d40e1b35a533991139137cae1509b1b24a0",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]U sport niet en doet geen yoga.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_aff534b9dd3af53156be",
   "sourceHash": "aff534b9dd3af53156be1e13be19f8551aa0eb9da68c230d20b485287a1c9273",
   "text": "Wist u dat?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e25736593d07ce53e422",
   "sourceHash": "e25736593d07ce53e42282028ae43ccdffe8f2b81dad12b950fc53c942d65413",
   "text": "Een verbluffend feit",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_15561c4d2bf9b8a6c2da",
   "sourceHash": "15561c4d2bf9b8a6c2dac297127db89b3b391f9f4e536afb165123c0d056f542",
   "text": "Volgens de Wereldgezondheidsorganisatie wordt traditionele geneeskunde gebruikt in meer dan 170 van haar 194 lidstaten. Panchakarma is een van de oudste gedocumenteerde systemen daarvan, en dat is wat onze artsen hier elke dag toepassen. Bent u eraan toe om goed voor uzelf te zorgen, dan vertelt een ayurvedische arts u waar u kunt beginnen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_849109ced4396a29e4cb",
   "sourceHash": "849109ced4396a29e4cbeeb72a5bdf72429bc910967faecb60ce5360ed3d7c01",
   "text": "Ja, ik wil gezond zijn",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_466c15cbfedce229a3fc",
   "sourceHash": "466c15cbfedce229a3fc7e2fbc3eaf00dfabe592074fe6d2cf3fda0b64082a17",
   "text": "van de WHO-lidstaten meldt gebruik van traditionele geneeskunde — 170 van de 194",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment following a percentage figure; translated to continue that figure."
   ]
  },
